        <name>
            <text>2.1.2.3 Funktionswert auswerten und Definitionsmenge [Evaluate value of function and domain]</text>
        </name>
        <questiontext format="html">
            <text><![CDATA[
<p class="HELM_exercise">
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Exercise
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="no">
        Øving
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Übung
    </span>
</p>
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Suppose \( \displaystyle G\left({@v@}\right) = {@fv@}\).
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="no">
        Gitt \( \displaystyle G\left({@v@}\right) = {@fv@}\).
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Angenommen \( \displaystyle G\left({@v@}\right) = {@fv@}\).
    </span>
</p>
<ol class="HELM_parts">
    <li>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                Evaluate: \( G\left({@v_val@}\right)=\)
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="no">
                Evaluer: \( G\left({@v_val@}\right)=\)
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                Werten Sie aus:
                <br/>
            </span>
        </p>
        \( G\left({@v_val@}\right)=\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:Result]]
        <p>
        </p>
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                Find a value of \( {@v@} \) such that \(G\left({@v@}\right) \) does not exist.
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="no">
                Finn en verdi for \( {@v@} \) slik at \(G\left({@v@}\right) \) ikke eksisterer.
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                Suchen Sie einen Wert von \( {@v@} \), sodass \(G\left({@v@}\right) \) nicht existiert.
            </span>
        </p>
        \({@v@}=\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]
    </li>
    <p>
        <br/>
    </p>
</ol>
]]></text>
        </questiontext>
        <generalfeedback format="html">
            <text><![CDATA[
<ol class="HELM_parts">
    <li>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                We must substitute {@v_val@} in place of {@v@} in the definition of the function:
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="no">
                Vi må substituere {@v@} med {@v_val@} i definisjonen for funksjonen:
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                Wir müssen {@v_val@} anstelle von {@v@} in der Definition der Funktion einsetzen:
            </span>
        </p>
        \[\begin{array}{rcl} G\left({@v_val@}\right) = \displaystyle \frac{{@a@}\cdot({@v_val@})+({@b@})}{{@c@}\cdot({@v_val@})+({@d@})} = \displaystyle
                                \frac{{@num_val@}}{{@den_val@}} = \displaystyle {@ta1@} \end{array}\]
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                We need to find the value of {@v@} for which the denominator is \(0\). So,
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="no">
                Vi må finne verdien for {@v@} så nevneren er \(0\). Da er,
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                Wir müssen den Wert von {@v@} finden, dessen Nenner \(0\) ist. Also,
            </span>
        </p>
        \[
                                {@den@}=0 \\ {@v@} = {@ta2@} \]
    </li>
</ol>
]]></text>
        </generalfeedback>
        <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
        <penalty>0.1000000</penalty>
        <hidden>0</hidden>
        <idnumber></idnumber>
